{
  "id": "book-24",
  "checkpoint": 8,
  "title": "Waiting at Platform Four",
  "summary": "Paul caminha até a plataforma quatro, confere o painel eletrônico de horários e conversa brevemente com outro passageiro enquanto aguarda o trem.",
  "audio_url": "/audios/book-24.mp3",
  "word_count_target": 140,
  "story_en": "Paul holds his ticket and walks toward platform four. A large electronic board displays the departure times and train numbers. The line for North Peak shows on time.\n\nHe steps onto the long concrete platform. Cool wind blows across the tracks. A few passengers stand with luggage, while others sit on metal benches checking their phones.\n\nAn elderly man wearing a dark coat notices Paul looking at the schedule. “Are you boarding the express train?” the man asks politely.\n\n“Yes, I am heading north,” Paul answers.\n\n“It usually arrives five minutes early,” the man explains with a friendly smile. “You will hear the loud whistle soon.”\n\nA distant engine sound echoes under the roof. Paul checks his watch, adjusts his backpack, and steps closer to the yellow safety line.",
